WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.11 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Reporting and communicating evidence

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Each audience needs its own report, honest from the very first one.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep outputs, outcomes and hopes clearly separate.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Include what did not work and what you changed.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Reuse the same data for every audience.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You build your reporting plan by audience.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
